{
  "id": 8835554541767,
  "title": "Custom Patriotic Semi Truck with Waving American Flag Comforter",
  "handle": "custom-patriotic-semi-truck-with-waving-american-flag-comforter-e01f2755b2-e01f2755b2",
  "body_html": "<p>Transform your bedroom with this custom trucker comforter set from Jeminise, designed for those who live life on the road. Featuring a patriotic semi truck design with a waving American flag, stars, and stripes, this bedding set brings a modern and stylish look to your decor. Perfect as a thoughtful gift for truckers and families, it offers a soft, cozy, and lightweight feel for comfortable sleep in any season.</p>\n\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Features a customizable text input field so you can personalize your trucker bedding with a name.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Cozy &amp; Lightweight Comfort:</strong> Made from soft brushed polyester fabric with whole-piece microfiber filling to prevent clumping or shifting.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Vibrant Digital Printing:</strong> High-definition digital printing ensures colors stay bright and vibrant without fading over time.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> The set includes 1 duvet cover or comforter, with options to add matching pillowcases or a flat sheet.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water, air dry or tumble dry on low heat for quick, fluffy results.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fill Material</th>\n<td>Microfiber</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Us Flag Trucker</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Trucker, Patriotic</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Cartoon</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Modern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
